WEBVTT

00:00:01.045 --> 00:00:08.283
Other sessions, on the Session step, imports earlier session files: here, two visits of the same patient.

00:00:08.419 --> 00:00:14.577
A report across visits can be exported as PDF or Word. Choose the sections it includes,

00:00:14.797 --> 00:00:19.214
and the scale targets that decide how configurations are ranked.

00:00:21.182 --> 00:00:23.277
Export saves the report.

